1. GRANT OF LICENSE
LuxDMX is distributed in two tiers within the commercial binary build:

(a) Free Core Tier (No License Key Required):
You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install
and execute the Free Core features (`probe`, `fixtures`, `gels`, `solve`,
raw single-universe `apply` with `--channels` or 2ch `--cct`/`--dim`,
`--dry-run` previews, `watch`, `restore`, and read-only/dry-run MCP tools)
for personal, evaluation, or commercial use.

(b) Pro Perpetual Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required):
Upon purchase of a valid LuxDMX Pro license key, Raymond de Oliveira grants
you a perpetual, non-exclusive, non-transferable license for one (1) named
individual to activate and use all Pro features (live Lee/Rosco gel presets,
CIE duv green/magenta tint output, multi-emitter RGB/RGBW/RGBWW/RGBMA/CCT-Tint
fixture control, multi-universe atomic `scene` execution, and Pro MCP write
tools) on up to three (3) personal macOS machines. Pro licenses operate offline
after activation with local key caching and zero usage telemetry.

