3. HARDWARE SAFETY & DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTY
LuxDMX emits standard Art-Net 4 and ANSI E1.31 sACN UDP frames and enforces
pre-write sniffing, sACN priority conflict detection, atomic snapshots, timed
auto-revert, and signal-safe restore. Because third-party lighting fixtures,
DMX nodes, and networks vary, THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT
WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO
WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR
NON-INFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY
CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR HARDWARE/LIGHTING MALFUNCTION ARISING FROM USE OF THIS
SOFTWARE.

